<title>HUNGARY: PRIMAGAZ H1 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 662 MLN.</title>
<headline>PRIMAGAZ H1 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 662 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		889	vs    837</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  827	vs    651</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		662	vs    479</p>
<p>    Net sales		     9,621	vs  7,880</p>
<p>    Costs of sales		5,466	vs  4,556</p>
<p>    Gross profit		  4,155	vs  3,324</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	952	vs    878</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    425	vs    220</p>
<p>    Other operating expend.   1,889	vs  1,389</p>
<p>    Interest received		56	vs     71</p>
<p>    Interest paid		   175	vs    269</p>
<p>    Other financial income	 57 profit vs   12 profit</p>
<p>    Taxation			  165	vs    172</p>
<p>NOTE - Primagaz Hungaria Rt is a liquified petroleum gas distributor.</p>
<p>The 1997 figures are unaudited and they were calculated in accordance with International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
